/E (Tiny Forest - There is a large electrical/utility box here that should remain in place and must stay accessible, but it should be screened from vandalism with green planting. The hedges currently there are non-native, possibly even sterile \(no nectar, etc.\), so they offer nothing to native insects. The idea is therefore to replace them and design the area a bit larger.)
